# Extracted from res://scripts/combat/arena_manager.gd
# Source material for the rewrite; not loaded by the game.
# Format: story/DIALOGUE_FORMAT.md

~ start_arena
Vex: Hold up, fighter! You need to be at least Level %d for the %s bracket. Come back when you've trained more!

~ abort_arena
Vex: DOWN at wave %d! Still, what a performance!
Vex: Endurance reward: +%d XP, +%d Gold

~ start_time_attack
Vex: You need Level %d for Time Attack %s!
Vex: TIME ATTACK! %s tier — you have %.0f seconds! GO GO GO!

~ _time_attack_timeout
Vex: TIME'S UP! So close! Better luck next time, fighter!

~ start_endurance
Vex: Endurance mode? You need at least Level 5 for that, rookie!
Vex: ENDURANCE MODE! How long can you survive? The crowd wants to know!

~ _start_next_wave
Vex: WAVE %d! The crowd is going INSANE!

~ _arena_win
Vex: Win streak: %d! Keep it up for even bigger rewards!
